WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Chris: Welcome to the campaign kickoff. Our summary: The campaign focuses on the pumpkin loaf and the new ordering app.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Chris: Launch week is 3 to 9 November.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Dev: Budget is 2,400 pounds, split between local radio and social posts.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Chris: Each shop gets its own sign-up code for the app.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Dev: Decision: Radio slots are booked for the first launch week only.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Chris: Action: Brief the social media agency. Please confirm by Friday.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Chris: Action: Create the sign-up codes for each shop. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Dev: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
